        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, mixed logs, at wood heater 6kW
Inventory for 1 MJ heat from hard wood logs, burned in a wood heater with a capacity of 6 kW. Annual efficiency is estimated with 77 % (Hu).;
Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
UUID: 3929dc16-ed82-319f-aa6e-e629079723e8
This module provides heat for end uses.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions
Technology: Efficiency of boiler of average technology available on the market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3929dc16-ed82-319f-aa6e-e629079723e8.xml</text>
